mindmap
root((how a plugin gets used))
  the five surfaces dsh gives a plugin
    the catalog row
      every turn, for every session
      truncated at 500 characters
        the rest is never shown to the model
    the skill body
      only when the skill loads
      the model chooses, from the row alone
    the reference hint
      dsh points the model at the references after loading
      the model decides whether the summary was enough
    the tool schema
      every turn, and never truncated
      the only surface with no ceiling
    the result
      reaches the model only after it already chose
      the one place that can route mid-task
  what each surface costs
    per turn, paid whether or not it is used
      catalog rows, 3293 characters
      tool schemas, 10885 characters
    on load, paid once
      a skill body, 79672 characters across all of them
    on follow-through
      references, 155325 characters if every hint is taken
  the asymmetry that decides everything
    the truncated surface is the one the model routes on
    the untruncated surface is the one it acts through
      so a when clause belongs in the tool description
        it is the only place with room for one
    and neither surface is read after a tool has run
      so the result has to carry the routing
  what the numbers say is missing
    0 of 12 tool descriptions open with a when clause
      the model reads these every turn and acts through them
    6 of 6 report families route to a sibling
      a report that says nothing next leaves the model where it was
    the catalog rows all fit, and none can grow
  the routes that do not depend on the model noticing
    a refusal names the sibling that would accept the input
      the model is already holding the wrong tool when it finds out
    nextSteps names the next tool, not the next idea
      a step the model cannot act on is a step it skips
    a finding code carries its domain in the prefix
      so the model can tell which skill explains it
    the report names the schema it follows
      the reading skill exists for exactly that
  where a usage claim is measurable
    the catalog, by the routing corpus
      measured at 93 of 93 on this plugin
    the tool surface, by the same method
      not measured yet: no corpus of tool-selection cases
    the result surface, by whether it names a sibling
      countable, and it is what the numbers above count
